-names></name><name><surname>Richardson</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Braga</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Menezes</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Soler</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Kume</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Zaninelli</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sokolows</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Pietrobon</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cross-cultural adaptation and validation of the Brazilian Portuguese version of the Neck Disability Index and Neck Pain and Disability Scale</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>2006</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>1621</fpage><lpage>1627</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16778699</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.brs.0000221989.53069.16</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vos</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Verhagen</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Koes</surname><given-names>BW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reliability and responsiveness of the Dutch version of the Neck Disability Index in patients with acute neck pain in general practice</article-title><source>Eur Spine J</source><year>2006</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>1729</fpage><lpage>1736</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16670840</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00586-006-0119-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Antonopoulou</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ekdahl</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Sgantzos</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Antonakis</surname><given-names>N</gi